cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this simulation and analysis workflow, please cite this repository release."
title: "Kinetic Ising Monte Carlo: Standard versus n-fold way"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: 2026-09-30
authors:
  - name: "Kinetic Ising Monte Carlo project contributors"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - Ising model
  - Monte Carlo
  - kinetic Monte Carlo
  - n-fold way
  - metastability
  - computational physics
  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Integrated C simulation and reproducible analysis workflow for comparing
  random single-spin Standard Monte Carlo with the n-fold way in metastable
  two-dimensional Ising dynamics, including validation datasets, physical-
  equivalence analysis and performance benchmarking.
